VALUES
  (492, 'Party Characters For Kids - New York', 'party-characters-for-kids-new-york', 1, 1, 33, 219, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 121+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids'' parties across the five boroughs from $255. Planning a playground birthday near Hippo Playground, a park picnic in Central Park, or a skating party at the LeFrak Center in Prospect Park? Our team sends police-style puppies, snow queens, classic clowns, holiday Santas, and more wherever your kids and guests are gathered. We have handled hundreds of New York parties over the years as part of the tens of thousands of events booked nationwide since 2014. Families in the Upper West Side often book characters for small lawn and playground gatherings in Riverside Park, while parents in Astoria or Jackson Heights invite performers to park meetups and neighborhood play streets. In Brooklyn Heights and Park Slope, characters are a familiar sight at weekend parties that spill into nearby parks and waterfront lawns during the main outdoor season from spring through early fall. Our performers travel to apartments, brownstones, community rooms, daycare centers, church halls, and public parks across the entire city and the greater metro area, including Brooklyn, Staten Island, and Edison, and we also regularly work in Bronx and White Plains. Every performer is insured and background-checked before appearing at a birthday, school event, daycare visit, company family day, or community festival. Call us at (855) 705-2799 to talk through your plans or enter your ZIP code to see characters available on your date and book in just a few minutes.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/new-york-ny/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (493, 'Party Characters For Kids - Los Angeles', 'party-characters-for-kids-los-angeles', 1, 1, 5, 27, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 189+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across Los Angeles from $255. Parents book us for Spider Character swings in the backyard, Santa Claus visits in December, silly Clown shows at park picnics, and mascots like Red Monster or Mr. Mouse at big family gatherings. We cover every neighborhood and nearby suburb, from Silver Lake and Echo Park to Culver City, Sherman Oaks, and Beverly Hills, plus the wider Greater Los Angeles metro like Glendale and Santa Monica. Our performers travel to your space, whether that is a reserved picnic area at Griffith Park’s Crystal Springs, a train-themed party at Travel Town, a pavilion at Lake Balboa Park in Van Nuys, or a simple backyard get-together that runs all afternoon. Families call us for birthdays most often, but we are also on site for school events at neighborhood recreation centers, church or community festivals at parks like Kenneth Hahn State Recreation Area, and holiday appearances at company family days. Every performer is insured and background-checked before joining our roster, and we have handled tens of thousands of parties since 2014, including over 1,000 here over the years.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/los-angeles-ca/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (494, 'Party Characters For Kids - Chicago', 'party-characters-for-kids-chicago', 1, 1, 14, 95, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 78+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across Chicago from $255. Planning a birthday at Oz Park, a school carnival in Logan Square, or a daycare visit near Rogers Park, and want a fun character to be the highlight? Since 2014, our insured, background-checked performers have entertained at tens of thousands of parties nationwide, including hundreds of Chicago parties over the years. Families book Clown shows in Lincoln Square near Welles Park, Santa Claus visits for winter events in Edison Park, and Spider Character meet and greets for apartment courtyard parties in the West Loop. We also visit school events, church festivals, and community block parties across the city. Our performers travel to you, whether the party is in a Lincoln Park condo party room, a backyard in Forest Glen, a picnic grove at Portage Park, or a rented field house room at Independence Park. We cover every neighborhood and the whole Greater Chicago area, and we also regularly work in Naperville, Orland Park, and Bolingbrook. To get started, call us at (855) 705-2799 , then enter your ZIP code to see who is available on your date and book online in a few clicks.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/chicago-il/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (495, 'Party Characters For Kids - Houston', 'party-characters-for-kids-houston', 1, 1, 44, 293, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 124+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across Houston from $255. We send superheroes, princesses, mascots, clowns, seasonal favorites like Santa Claus and the Easter Bunny, and many others to birthdays, school functions, church festivals, and community events all over the city. Families book us for backyard parties in Oak Forest, park picnics at Levy Park’s Family Pavilion, character visits after a Houston Zoo outing near Hermann Park, and school carnivals from Meyerland to Kingwood. We cover every neighborhood inside the city plus the greater metro, and we also regularly work in suburbs such as Cypress, Spring, Pearland, Sugar Land, and other nearby communities. Outdoor celebrations are popular locally, so many parents choose spring or fall dates, or reserve shaded pavilions at places like Memorial Park’s Vale-Asche playground or Buffalo Bayou Park for summer parties. If you plan to use a city park with inflatables, the Parks and Recreation Department may require a permit and proof of insurance, and our performers are fully insured and background-checked before joining our roster.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/houston-tx/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
