  (497, 'Party Characters For Kids - Austin', 'party-characters-for-kids-austin', 1, 1, 44, 296, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 37+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ events across Austin from $255. Planning a backyard birthday in Circle C Ranch, a park party at Zilker Park, or a holiday visit at home in Allandale, we send pro performers who know how to light up kids’ faces. Our roster covers everything from a Spider Character entrance that gets kids cheering to a Snow Queen visit that feels magical for preschoolers. Families in Cherrywood often book cozy backyard birthdays, while Mueller parents lean on spots like Mueller Lake Park or community courtyards. We have handled school fun days, daycare visits, and church festivals in the Greater Austin metro, and we also regularly work in Cedar Park, Round Rock, Leander, Pflugerville, Buda, Hutto, and Kyle. Since 2014, our family business has booked tens of thousands of parties nationwide and more than 1,000 local events over the years. Performers are insured, background-checked, and they travel to your home, park, community center, or venue. Call us at (855) 705-2799 to talk through your plans, or enter your ZIP code to see which characters are available on your date and book in a few clicks.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/austin-tx/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (498, 'Party Characters For Kids - San Antonio', 'party-characters-for-kids-san-antonio', 1, 1, 44, 294, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 43+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across San Antonio from $255. Our performers travel to homes, parks, schools, churches, and event spaces all over the city, from backyard birthdays in Alamo Heights to pavilion parties at O. P. Schnabel Park. We have helped with hundreds of San Antonio parties over the years as part of the tens of thousands of events we have supported nationwide since 2014. Planning a birthday at Brackenridge Park, a preschool visit near Mahncke Park, or a church festival on the North Side I‑10 corridor? We send character favorites like Ninja Character Donatel, Speedy Hedgehog, Snow Queen, Dark Lord, and more to keep kids laughing and engaged with games, photos, and cake time. Local families also invite us to MacArthur Park, Landa Gardens, and neighborhood clubhouses when they want entertainment that fits right into outdoor living. Our coverage includes every neighborhood and suburb in the greater metro area, from Stone Oak and the Great Northwest to Southtown, Helotes, Bulverde, and the historic central neighborhoods. Performers are fully insured and background checked, and the climate here lets us support outdoor gatherings nearly year round, though many parents pick shaded pavilions for hot summer afternoons. Call us at (855) 705-2799 to talk through your party details, then enter your ZIP code to see which characters are available on your date and book in a few minutes.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/san-antonio-tx/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (499, 'Party Characters For Kids - San Diego', 'party-characters-for-kids-san-diego', 1, 1, 5, 28, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 43+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across San Diego from $255. Planning a backyard birthday in Carmel Valley, a park celebration near Lake Murray, or a holiday visit from Santa Claus at home, we send professional characters who know how to keep local kids laughing and involved. Parents book our Spider Character, Speedy Hedgehog, clowns, the Easter Bunny, Santa Claus, and even a spooky Dark Lord for birthdays, school events, church festivals, and neighborhood block parties. Our performers come to you anywhere in the city and nearby suburbs, from Scripps Ranch and Pacific Beach to City Heights and the Encanto neighborhoods area, and we also regularly work in Chula Vista and El Cajon. Enter your ZIP code to see who is available on your date and choose the time length that fits your schedule. Most families pick a 60 minute visit for small groups, a 90 minute visit for medium parties, or 2 hours when they want extra time for games and photos. If you are using a public park like Kate Sessions Memorial Park or one of the developed regional parks around Mission Bay, the city may ask you to reserve a picnic area or structure for organized birthday parties, so it helps to pick your spot before you confirm entertainment. To talk through timing, local park norms, or which character fits your theme best, call us at (855) 705-2799 or start by entering your ZIP code to book online.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/san-diego-ca/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (500, 'Party Characters For Kids - San Francisco', 'party-characters-for-kids-san-francisco', 1, 1, 5, 30, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 61+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across San Francisco starting at $255. Need a Clown for a park picnic, a Spider Character for a superhero-obsessed kid, or Santa Claus for a holiday event at your school or church? Our team sends insured, background-checked performers to homes, parks, and community spaces all over the city and the greater metro. Families in Noe Valley, often called “Stroller Valley,” love pairing a character visit with a nearby playground get-together, while parents in Bernal Heights use spots like Holly Park for low-key birthdays and picnics. Closer to Golden Gate Park, Inner Sunset and Outer Sunset families often reserve picnic areas in places like Lindley Meadow or Hellman Hollow, then time the character’s arrival for cake and photos. In Glen Park or West Portal, many parents keep things simple with backyard parties or a character visit in a small rental room. We cover every neighborhood and all nearby suburbs, from the Excelsior District and the Tenderloin to the Greater San Francisco metro, including Fremont and Oakland. We have handled tens of thousands of parties nationwide since 2014, and hundreds of San Francisco parties over the years, for birthdays, school carnivals, daycare visits, corporate family days, and more. Call us at (855) 705-2799 to talk through your ideas, then enter your ZIP code to see which characters are available on your date and book in minutes.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/san-francisco-ca/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (501, 'Party Characters For Kids - Las Vegas', 'party-characters-for-kids-las-vegas', 1, 1, 29, 194, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 31+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ events across Las Vegas from $255. Our professional, fully insured entertainers travel to your home, park, school, church, or venue so you can relax while the kids go wild for their favorite visitor. Families book everything from Santa Claus and Grinch visits at covered picnic areas in places like Angel Park or All American Park, to Storybook Princess meet-and-greets at neighborhood clubhouses in Summerlin or Nevada Trails. We have handled hundreds of Las Vegas parties over the years, including birthdays, school carnivals, daycare visits, and community festivals, so we know how to keep a group of excited kids happy in desert heat or cooler fall evenings. From Centennial Hills and its splash-pad playgrounds to Southwest Spring Valley and downtown-adjacent neighborhoods near the Arts District, we cover every part of the city and nearby suburbs, and we also regularly work in Henderson and North Las Vegas. Hot desert summers here can hit triple digits, so our team is used to planning character activities around shade and cooler times of day, especially for park parties at spots like Centennial Hills Park or Children’s Memorial Park.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/las-vegas-nv/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (502, 'Party Characters For Kids - Phoenix', 'party-characters-for-kids-phoenix', 1, 1, 3, 13, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 50+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids'' parties across Phoenix from $255. From clowns to princess-style characters, mascots and seasonal favorites, our team travels to homes, parks, schools and community events all over the city and the greater metro. Families in Desert Ridge and North Phoenix often invite a Clown or Spider Character to park parties at spots like Altadena Park, while parents near Encanto Village and Encanto-Palmcroft love adding a Snow Queen or Mrs. Mouse visit to their gatherings at Encanto Park. Downtown and Midtown families hosting in apartments regularly meet performers at Civic Space Park or Margaret T. Hance Park so kids have room to run. We also regularly work in Scottsdale, Chandler and Gilbert for school events, church festivals and neighborhood block parties. Outdoor celebrations are popular here, especially in the sunny fall, winter and spring months, so our performers are used to joining ramada parties at places like Hermoso Park, Playa Margarita Park, Papago Park and Steele Indian School Park. If you are reserving a park ramada through the city’s system, you handle the permit and we coordinate arrival and performance around your time slot.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/phoenix-az/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (503, 'Party Characters For Kids - Denver', 'party-characters-for-kids-denver', 1, 1, 6, 41, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 27+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids'' parties across Denver from $255. We send Santa Claus, princess-style performers, superheroes like Spider Character, silly mascots such as Fun Clown, and more right to your home, park, school, church festival, or community event. Families use us for backyard birthdays in Washington Park, park picnics in City Park and Sloan''s Lake Park, daycare visits in Central Park, and school events near Berkeley Lake Park. We also help with holiday visits from Santa Claus, block parties, and corporate family days around places like Washington Park Recreation Center or Congress Park Pool, so kids see their favorite characters in the middle of the fun. Our performers are insured, background-checked, and trained to handle excited kids, tight schedules, and Colorado weather. We have done hundreds of Greater Denver parties over the years and also regularly work in Littleton and Aurora for parents who want the same reliable character fun outside the city. You can call us at (855) 705-2799 to talk through your plan, then pay a deposit online to lock in your time. Enter your ZIP code to see which characters are available on your date anywhere in Denver or the surrounding suburbs.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/denver-co/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (504, 'Party Characters For Kids - Atlanta', 'party-characters-for-kids-atlanta', 1, 1, 11, 75, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 53+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across Atlanta from $255. We send superheroes, princess-style characters, mascots, clowns and holiday favorites right to your home, park pavilion or community space so you can focus on the fun instead of the logistics. Families all over the city use us for backyard birthdays in Virginia-Highland, park parties at Grant Park and Candler Park pavilions, and apartment clubhouse events around Old Fourth Ward. Our Santa Claus, Easter Bunny and Grinch visits are popular for holiday events, and we also help schools, churches and daycares bring characters to family nights, festivals and seasonal celebrations. We serve every neighborhood and the broader metro area, and we also regularly work in Decatur, Stockbridge and Alpharetta. Since 2014, we have handled tens of thousands of parties nationwide, including hundreds of Atlanta parties over the years, so our team knows how to keep kids engaged with photos, games and cake singing. You can pay a deposit online to lock in your time, then the rest is due on party day with the performer. If you would rather talk it through, call us at (855) 705-2799 , or enter your ZIP code now to see characters available in your part of the city.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/atlanta-ga/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (505, 'Party Characters For Kids - Miami', 'party-characters-for-kids-miami', 1, 1, 10, 64, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service bringing costumed performers to kids’ parties across Miami from $255. Our insured, background-checked entertainers visit condos in Brickell, backyards in Coral Way, playground parties in Coconut Grove, and gatherings near Maurice A. Ferré Park. Families call us for birthdays most often, but we are also busy with school events, daycare visits, and community festivals across the area. Spider Character is a favorite for action-loving kids, while Honey Bear, Clown performers, and the Snow Queen are popular for park parties at places like Tropical Park or Indian Hammocks Park. Holiday events often feature Santa Claus, and some families mix in characters such as Dark Lord, Cow Boy, or Bob the Constractor for themed celebrations. Miami’s warm weather means outdoor character visits happen almost year round, from beachside parties near Matheson Hammock Park to picnic shelters in city parks. We serve every neighborhood and nearby suburb, from Coconut Grove and Shenandoah to North Beach and Pinecrest, and we also regularly work in Kendall, West Kendall, and Doral. You pay a deposit online to lock in your performer and time, then the remaining balance is due on party day. Call us at (855) 705-2799 to talk through your plans, then enter your ZIP code to see who is available on your date and book in a few clicks.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/miami-fl/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (506, 'Party Characters For Kids - Tampa', 'party-characters-for-kids-tampa', 1, 1, 10, 65, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 25+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids’ parties across Tampa from $255. Planning a backyard birthday in Westchase, a park party at Ballast Point Park, or a school event near the Downtown Riverwalk. Our clowns, princesses, mascots, and holiday favorites come to you, so you can relax and enjoy the fun. Families all over the area already use character visits as a centerpiece for birthdays, daycare and preschool visits, church festivals, and school carnivals. We have hosted hundreds of local parties over the years as part of the tens of thousands of celebrations our team has booked nationwide since 2014. From Tampa Palms and New Tampa down through South Tampa and Hyde Park, and out into the greater metro including Clearwater and Bradenton, we cover every neighborhood and nearby suburb. Thinking about an outdoor party at Curtis Hixon Waterfront Park or Water Works Park. We can talk through timing around the afternoon heat and typical summer storms so your character visit fits your schedule. Just call us at (855) 705-2799 for planning help, then enter your ZIP code on our site to see which characters are available on your date and book in a few minutes.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/tampa-fl/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW()),
  (507, 'Party Characters For Kids - Philadelphia', 'party-characters-for-kids-philadelphia', 1, 1, 39, 261, 'Characters For Party is a family-owned character rental service with 55+ local performers bringing costumed characters to kids'' parties across Philadelphia from $255. We send superheroes, princesses, mascots and seasonal favorites right to your home, park, school, daycare, church festival or corporate family day. Families book our Speedy Hedgehog for energetic game time in Fairmount, invite Police Puppy to playground birthdays in Queen Village, and bring Red Monster along for cake at parks in Roxborough or West Philly. In Fitler Square and Center City, parents often plan simple outdoor parties at neighborhood spots like Schuylkill River Park or Seger Park and let our performer handle activities, photos and birthday spotlight time. Our performers travel to every neighborhood and surrounding suburb, from Manayunk and East Falls to Northwest Philly and nearby towns such as Cherry Hill and Villanova. We have handled hundreds of local bookings, including visits to McMichael Park in East Falls and Daisy Field in Roxborough, and have been part of tens of thousands of parties nationwide since 2014. If your party is in a city park like Pretzel Park or FDR Park and you plan a larger gathering, Philadelphia Parks & Recreation may ask you to get a picnic or event permit.', 'https://charactersforparty.com/birthday-party-character-rental/philadelphia-pa/', 'https://charactersforparty.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/favicon-300x300.png', '+1 855-705-2799', 'info@charactersforparty.com', 255.00, 0, 0, 'active', NOW(), NOW());


